Package: lmrs
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         docker.io | docker-ce,
         systemd,
         adduser,
         openssl,
         ca-certificates
Description: Local Model Runtime Service (LMRS) container deployment
 Installs and runs LMRS as a systemd-managed Docker container. The image
 bundles a vLLM (+ LMCache) model server with the LMRS mcp_proxy_adapter
 server; only the LMRS server is exposed externally, while vLLM stays on
 loopback inside the container. Host directories /etc/lmrs, /var/lmrs and
 /var/log/lmrs are bind-mounted into the container.
